From f02aa79cbe6dcd87253f148edf97257415dfa42c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lukin <mylukin@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Mar 2026 15:31:20 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 42/98] refactor(feishu): migrate streaming-card from raw HTTP
 to Lark SDK

Replace all fetchWithSsrFGuard raw HTTP calls with official Lark Node
SDK methods (cardkit.v1.card.create/settings/update,
cardkit.v1.cardElement.content, im.message.delete).

Removed: tokenCache, getToken(), resolveApiBase(),
resolveAllowedHostnames(), and manual Bearer token management.

Added: stripHtmlTagsToText() with proper HTML entity decoding for
card summary generation.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
